<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('learnhub-theme');if(!t&&window.matchMedia)t=window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light';if(t)document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);}catch(e){}})();</script>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Add Course — LearnHub</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="app-body">

    <%- include('_navbar', { active: 'courses', name, role }) %>

    <div class="page-content">

        <a href="/courses" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; color:#6b7280; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:20px; font-size:.9rem;">
            ← Back to Courses
        </a>

        <div class="page-header">
            <div>
                <h1 class="page-title">Add New Course</h1>
                <p class="page-subtitle">Fill in the details below to create your course</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="white-card" style="max-width:820px;">
<% if (typeof error !== 'undefined') { %><div class="error-msg" style="margin-bottom:20px;"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<form action="/courses/add" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
<div class="field"><label for="title">Course Title *</label><input id="title" name="title" required minlength="3" placeholder="e.g. Full-Stack JavaScript Masterclass"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="thumbnail">Course Thumbnail URL</label><input id="thumbnail" name="thumbnail" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com/course-image.jpg"><span class="field-note">Optional image URL.</span><label style="margin-top:8px">Or upload thumbnail</label><input name="thumbnailFile" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif"><span class="field-note">JPG/PNG/WEBP/GIF, max 2 MB.</span></div>
<div class="field"><label for="description">Description *</label><textarea id="description" name="description" required minlength="10" placeholder="Explain what students will learn and who the course is for..."></textarea></div>
<div class="field-row"><div class="field"><label for="category">Category</label><select id="category" name="category"><% (categories || []).forEach(x=>{ %><option value="<%=x.name%>"><%=x.name%></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="field"><label for="level">Difficulty</label><select id="level" name="level"><option>Beginner</option><option>Intermediate</option><option>Advanced</option></select></div></div>
<div class="field"><label for="duration">Duration</label><input id="duration" name="duration" placeholder="e.g. 8 weeks, 20 hours"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="learningOutcomes">What students will learn</label><textarea id="learningOutcomes" name="learningOutcomes" placeholder="Build responsive web apps
Work with APIs and databases
Deploy a production application"></textarea><span class="field-note">One learning outcome per line.</span></div>
<div class="field"><label for="lessons">Course Curriculum</label><textarea id="lessons" name="lessons" placeholder="HTML & CSS Foundations | Build the page structure | 25 min | Learn semantic HTML and modern CSS
JavaScript Essentials | Variables, functions and DOM | 35 min | Practice core JavaScript
Final Project | Build and deploy a project | 60 min | Put everything together"></textarea><span class="field-note">One lesson per line. Format: <b>Title | Short description | Duration | Video URL | Lesson content</b>. Video URL can be a YouTube link or direct MP4/WebM URL.</span></div><div class="field"><label>Upload Lesson Videos (optional)</label><div style="display:grid;gap:10px;"><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 1<input name="lessonVideo0" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 2<input name="lessonVideo1" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 3<input name="lessonVideo2" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 4<input name="lessonVideo3" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 5<input name="lessonVideo4" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 6<input name="lessonVideo5" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 7<input name="lessonVideo6" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 8<input name="lessonVideo7" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 9<input name="lessonVideo8" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label><label style="font-weight:600">Lesson 10<input name="lessonVideo9" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm,video/ogg,video/quicktime"></label></div><span class="field-note">Each uploaded video is saved to Cloudinary and automatically assigned to the matching lesson. MP4/WebM/OGG/MOV, max 50 MB each.</span></div>
<div class="field"><label for="quizName">Quiz Name</label><input id="quizName" name="quizName" placeholder="e.g. Final Course Quiz"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="quizQuestions">Quiz Questions (optional)</label><textarea id="quizQuestions" name="quizQuestions" placeholder="Question | Option A | Option B | Option C | Option D | Correct Option Number
What does HTML stand for? | Hyper Text Markup Language | High Text Machine Language | Hyperlink Text Markup Language | Home Tool Markup Language | 0"></textarea><span class="field-note">One question per line. Correct Option Number is <b>0, 1, 2, or 3</b>. Exactly 4 options are required.</span></div>
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-blue" style="padding:13px 32px;font-size:1rem;">✓ Create Course</button>
</form></div></div></main></body></html>